		fmt = '1. The qualifiers follow an elimination format with a total of 10 matches. Each match lasts 4 minutes and rankings are based on the number of wins. If wins are tied, rankings are determined by points.',
		fmt_ma = '1. Pusingan awal adalah format penyingkiran, jumlah 10 pertarungan, setiap satu 4 minit, ranking berdasarkan kemenangan. Jika seri, ikut mata  ',
		fmt_en = '1. The qualifiers follow an elimination format with a total of 10 matches. Each match lasts 4 minutes and rankings are based on the number of wins. If wins are tied, rankings are determined by points.',
