		fmt_in = '2. Menang mendapat peti emas, kalah mendapat peti perak',
		fmt_th = '2. ชนะจะได้รับหีบทอง แพ้จะได้รับหีบเงิน',
		fmt_ph = '2. Kung mananalo, makakatanggap ng golden chest, kung matatalo, makakatanggap ng silver chest.',
		fmt_vn = '2. Thắng sẽ nhận được rương vàng, thua sẽ nhận được rương bạc.'
	},
	[42003] = {
		id = 42003,
		fmt = '3. Both chests have a chance to contain martial arts commemorative items and other rewards.',
		fmt_ma = '3. Kedua-dua peti berpeluang mengandungi item kenang-kenangan Seni Bela Diri dan item lain',
		fmt_en = '3. Both chests have a chance to contain martial arts commemorative items and other rewards.',
		fmt_in = '3. Kedua jenis peti berpeluang berisi item kenang-kenangan martial arts dan item lainnya',
		fmt_th = '3. ทั้งสองประเภทมีโอกาสเปิดได้ไอเทมที่ระลึกศิลปะการต่อสู้และไอเทมอื่นๆ',
		fmt_ph = '3. Ang parehong uri ng chest ay may pagkakataong magbukas ng mga reward na may kinalaman sa martial arts memorabilia at iba pang item.',
		fmt_vn = '3. Cả hai loại rương đều có cơ hội mở ra vật phẩm kỷ niệm võ đạo và các vật phẩm khác.'
	},
	[42004] = {
		id = 42004,
		fmt = '4. Ranking rewards can be obtained based on the player’s rank in that day’s martial arts competition.',
		fmt_ma = '4. Ganjaran ranking diberikan berdasarkan kedudukan pada hari kejohanan',
		fmt_en = '4. Ranking rewards can be obtained based on the player’s rank in that day’s martial arts competition.',
		fmt_in = '4. Hadiah peringkat didapat berdasarkan peringkat turnamen hari itu',
		fmt_th = '4. รางวัลจัดอันดับจะได้รับตามอันดับในการแข่งขันประจำวันนั้น',
		fmt_ph = '4. Ang ranking rewards ay ibibigay base sa pagkakasunod-sunod ng laban sa araw na iyon.',
		fmt_vn = '4. Phần thưởng xếp hạng có thể nhận được dựa trên thứ hạng của cuộc thi võ thuật vào ngày hôm đó.'
	},
	[43001] = {
		id = 43001,
		fmt = '#C0xFFF5D6#1. Initially, you can play 5 times per day. Upgrading the \'Fire Hero Summon\' technology in the research institute can increase the number of plays.',
		fmt_ma = '#C0xFFF5D6#1. Pada awalnya, setiap hari boleh bermain 5 kali; menaik taraf teknologi \'Goncang Wira Api\' di institut penyelidikan boleh meningkatkan bilangan percubaan.  ',
		fmt_en = '#C0xFFF5D6#1. Initially, you can play 5 times per day. Upgrading the \'Fire Hero Summon\' technology in the research institute can increase the number of plays.',
		fmt_in = '#C0xFFF5D6#1. Awalnya tiap hari bisa bermain 5 kali, di laboratorium riset upgrade teknologi \'Putar Pahlawan Api\' bisa meningkatkan jumlah permainan',
		fmt_th = '#C0xFFF5D6#1. เริ่มต้นเล่นได้วันละ 5 ครั้ง อัปเกรดเทคโนโลยี ‘สุ่มฮีโร่ไฟ’ ในศูนย์วิจัยเพื่อเพิ่มจำนวนครั้งเล่น',
		fmt_ph = '#C0xFFF5D6#1. Sa simula, maaari kang maglaro ng 5 beses bawat araw, maaari mong pataasin ang bilang ng mga laro sa pamamagitan ng pag-upgrade ng teknolohiyang \'Rung ra anh hùng lửa\' sa research institute.',
		fmt_vn = '#C0xFFF5D6#1. Ban đầu mỗi ngày có thể chơi 5 lần, trong viện nghiên cứu nâng cấp công nghệ \'Rung ra anh hùng lửa\' có thể tăng số lần chơi.'
	},
	[43002] = {
		id = 43002,
		fmt = '#C0xFFF5D6#2. Initially, this mode allows 5 free summon refreshes per day. Similarly, upgrading the related technology in the research institute can increase the number of free refreshes.',
		fmt_ma = '#C0xFFF5D6#2. Mod ini pada mulanya memberikan 5 kali pertukaran goncangan percuma; menaik taraf teknologi berkaitan di institut penyelidikan boleh meningkatkan jumlah pertukaran percuma.',
		fmt_en = '#C0xFFF5D6#2. Initially, this mode allows 5 free summon refreshes per day. Similarly, upgrading the related technology in the research institute can increase the number of free refreshes.',
		fmt_in = '#C0xFFF5D6#2. Awalnya mode ini bisa gratis memutar 5 kali, di laboratorium riset upgrade teknologi terkait bisa meningkatkan jumlah putaran gratis',
		fmt_th = '#C0xFFF5D6#2. เริ่มต้นสามารถสุ่มฟรีได้ 5 ครั้งต่อวัน อัปเกรดเทคโนโลยีที่เกี่ยวข้องในศูนย์วิจัยเพื่อเพิ่มจำนวนสุ่มฟรี',
		fmt_ph = '#C0xFFF5D6#2. Sa simula, ang mode na ito ay may libreng 5 beses na pag-reroll, gayundin, maaari mong dagdagan ang libreng reroll sa pamamagitan ng pag-upgrade ng kaugnay na teknolohiya sa research institute.',
		fmt_vn = '#C0xFFF5D6#2. Ban đầu chế độ này có thể miễn phí đổi rung 5 lần, tương tự, trong viện nghiên cứu nâng cấp công nghệ liên quan, có thể tăng số lần đổi rung miễn phí.'
	},
	[43003] = {
		id = 43003,
		fmt = '#C0xFFF5D6#3. Summoned fire heroes will not disappear. The more fire heroes you have, the greater the rewards. You can obtain fire hero shards and a large amount of guild coins.',
		fmt_ma = '#C0xFFF5D6#3. Wira api yang telah digoncang tidak akan hilang. Semakin banyak wira api yang diperoleh, semakin besar ganjaran, termasuk cebisan wira api dan sejumlah besar syiling persekutuan.  ',
		fmt_en = '#C0xFFF5D6#3. Summoned fire heroes will not disappear. The more fire heroes you have, the greater the rewards. You can obtain fire hero shards and a large amount of guild coins.',
		fmt_in = '#C0xFFF5D6#3. Pahlawan api yang sudah diputar tidak akan hilang. Semakin banyak pahlawan api, semakin besar hadiah, bisa mendapatkan pecahan pahlawan api dan banyak koin guild',
		fmt_th = '#C0xFFF5D6#3. ฮีโร่ไฟที่สุ่มได้จะไม่หายไป ยิ่งมีฮีโร่ไฟมาก รางวัลยิ่งเยอะ จะได้รับชิ้นส่วนฮีโร่ไฟและเหรียญกิลด์จำนวนมาก',
		fmt_ph = '#C0xFFF5D6#3. Ang mga Fire Hero na nakuha ay hindi mawawala.',
		fmt_vn = '#C0xFFF5D6#3. Các anh hùng lửa đã quay ra sẽ không biến mất.4. Số lượng anh hùng lửa càng nhiều, phần thưởng càng lớn, có thể nhận được mảnh anh hùng lửa và lượng lớn tiền hội.'
	},
	[43004] = {
		id = 43004,
		fmt = '#C0xFFF5D6#4. The more fire-type heroes you have, the more generous the rewards. You can obtain fire-type hero shards and a large amount of guild coins.',
		fmt_ma = '#C0xFFF5D6#4. Semakin banyak wira unsur api yang dimiliki, semakin lumayan ganjarannya, boleh mendapatkan cebisan wira unsur api dan banyak syiling persekutuan.  ',
		fmt_en = '#C0xFFF5D6#4. The more fire-type heroes you have, the more generous the rewards. You can obtain fire-type hero shards and a large amount of guild coins.',
		fmt_in = '#C0xFFF5D6#4. Semakin banyak pahlawan elemen Api, semakin besar hadiahnya, bisa mendapatkan pecahan pahlawan elemen Api dan banyak koin guild',
		fmt_th = '#C0xFFF5D6#4. ยิ่งมีฮีโร่ธาตุไฟมาก รางวัลยิ่งดี จะได้รับชิ้นส่วนฮีโร่ธาตุไฟและเหรียญกิลด์จำนวนมาก',
		fmt_ph = '#C0xFFF5D6#4. Mas maraming Fire Hero ang mayroon ka, mas malaki ang gantimpala, maaari kang makatanggap ng Fire Hero fragments at malaking halaga ng Guild Coins.',
		fmt_vn = '#C0xFFF5D6#4. Càng có nhiều anh hùng hệ Hỏa, phần thưởng càng hậu hĩnh, có thể nhận được mảnh anh hùng hệ Hỏa và rất nhiều tiền bang hội.'
	},
	[44001] = {
		id = 44001,
		fmt = '1. Guild dungeon open time: Monday to Saturday 9:30-23:30, closed on Sunday;',
		fmt_ma = '1. Masa buka dungeon persekutuan: Isnin hingga Sabtu 9:30-23:30, Ahad tutup;  ',
		fmt_en = '1. Guild dungeon open time: Monday to Saturday 9:30-23:30, closed on Sunday;',
		fmt_in = '1. Waktu buka dungeon guild: Senin sampai Sabtu 9:30-23:30, Minggu libur',
		fmt_th = '1. เวลาปิดดันเจี้ยนกิลด์: จันทร์ถึงเสาร์ 9:30-23:30 หยุดวันอาทิตย์',
		fmt_ph = '1. Oras ng pagbubukas ng Guild Dungeon: Lunes hanggang Sabado 9:30-23:30, sarado tuwing Linggo;',
		fmt_vn = '1. Thời gian mở cửa phó bản công hội: Thứ Hai đến Thứ Bảy 9:30-23:30, Chủ Nhật nghỉ;'
	},
	[44002] = {
		id = 44002,
		fmt = '2. The system automatically refreshes the dungeon at 5:00 AM on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, refreshing only the highest difficulty dungeon currently in progress; at 23:30 on Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday, after the guild dungeon closes, the system will calculate and distribute damage ranking rewards.',
		fmt_ma = '2. Sistem akan menyegar semula dungeon pada jam 5 pagi setiap Isnin, Rabu, dan Jumaat, hanya dungeon dengan tahap kesukaran tertinggi dalam kemajuan semasa akan disegar semula; pada jam 23:30 setiap Selasa, Khamis dan Sabtu, selepas dungeon ditutup, sistem akan mengira dan mengagihkan ganjaran kedudukan kerosakan.  ',
		fmt_en = '2. The system automatically refreshes the dungeon at 5:00 AM on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, refreshing only the highest difficulty dungeon currently in progress; at 23:30 on Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday, after the guild dungeon closes, the system will calculate and distribute damage ranking rewards.',
		fmt_in = '2. Sistem otomatis refresh dungeon jam 5 pagi setiap Senin, Rabu, dan Jumat, hanya refresh dungeon dengan tingkat kesulitan tertinggi dalam progres saat ini; jam 23:30 setiap Selasa, Kamis, dan Sabtu, setelah dungeon guild ditutup, sistem akan menghitung dan membagikan hadiah peringkat damage',
		fmt_th = '2. ระบบจะรีเฟรชดันเจี้ยนเวลา 5:00 ของวันจันทร์ พุธ ศุกร์ โดยรีเฟรชเฉพาะดันเจี้ยนที่ยากที่สุดในปัจจุบัน และเวลา 23:30 ของวันอังคาร พฤหัส เสาร์ หลังปิดดันเจี้ยน ระบบจะคำนวณและแจกของรางวัลอันดับความเสียหาย',
		fmt_ph = '2. Awtomatikong nire-reset ng system ang dungeon tuwing 5AM ng Lunes, Miyerkules, at Biyernes, ire-reset lamang ang dungeon na may pinakamataas na antas ng kahirapan sa kasalukuyang progreso; tuwing 23:30 ng Martes, Huwebes, at Sabado, pagkatapos magsara ang Guild Dungeon, awtomatikong magkakaroon ng settlement at ipapamahagi ang damage ranking rewards.',
		fmt_vn = '2. Hệ thống tự động làm mới phó bản vào 5 giờ sáng các ngày thứ Hai, thứ Tư và thứ Sáu, chỉ làm mới phó bản có độ khó cao nhất trong tiến trình hiện tại; vào 23:30 các ngày thứ Ba, thứ Năm và thứ Bảy, sau khi phó bản bang hội đóng cửa, hệ thống sẽ thống nhất结算 và phát phần thưởng xếp hạng sát thương.'
	},
	[44003] = {
		id = 44003,
		fmt = '3. Each day there are 3 challenge attempts shared across all dungeons, refreshed at 5:00 AM daily. During challenges, there is a chance to obtain guild boss chests;',
		fmt_ma = '3. Setiap hari mempunyai 3 peluang cabaran, digunakan bersama untuk semua dungeon, disegar semula pada jam 5 pagi setiap hari; semasa cabaran, berpeluang memperoleh peti bos persekutuan.  ',
		fmt_en = '3. Each day there are 3 challenge attempts shared across all dungeons, refreshed at 5:00 AM daily. During challenges, there is a chance to obtain guild boss chests;',
		fmt_in = '3. Setiap hari ada 3 kesempatan tantangan, semua dungeon berbagi kesempatan ini, di-reset jam 5 pagi setiap hari, selama tantangan ada peluang mendapatkan peti boss guild',
		fmt_th = '3. ต่อวันมี 3 ครั้งท้าทาย ใช้ร่วมกันทุกดันเจี้ยน รีเฟรชเวลา 5:00 ของทุกวัน ระหว่างการท้าทายมีโอกาสได้รับหีบ Boss กิลด์',
		fmt_ph = '3. May 3 challenge attempts bawat araw, lahat ng dungeon ay gumagamit ng parehong bilang ng attempts, nire-reset tuwing 5AM bawat araw, may pagkakataon makakuha ng Guild Boss Chest habang lumalaban;',
		fmt_vn = '3. Mỗi ngày có 3 lượt khiêu chiến, tất cả các phó bản dùng chung số lượt này, được làm mới vào 5 giờ sáng mỗi ngày, trong quá trình khiêu chiến có cơ hội nhận được rương boss của công hội;'
	},
	[44004] = {
		id = 44004,
		fmt = '4. After clearing the current dungeon, the next dungeon will be unlocked. Cleared dungeons cannot be replayed until the monthly reset.',
		fmt_ma = '4. Selepas dungeon semasa dilengkapkan, dungeon seterusnya akan dibuka; dungeon yang telah diselesaikan tidak boleh dimainkan semula sehingga tetapan semula bulanan.  ',
		fmt_en = '4. After clearing the current dungeon, the next dungeon will be unlocked. Cleared dungeons cannot be replayed until the monthly reset.',
		fmt_in = '4. Setelah menyelesaikan dungeon saat ini, dungeon berikutnya akan terbuka, dungeon yang sudah diselesaikan tidak bisa dimainkan ulang sebelum reset bulanan',
		fmt_th = '4. ผ่านดันเจี้ยนปัจจุบันจะปลดล็อกดันเจี้ยนถัดไป ดันเจี้ยนที่ผ่านแล้วจะไม่สามารถเล่นซ้ำได้จนกว่าจะรีเซ็ตประจำเดือน',
		fmt_ph = '4. Kapag natapos ang kasalukuyang dungeon, bubuksan ang susunod na dungeon, ang mga natapos na dungeon ay hindi pwedeng ulitin bago ang buwanang reset.',
		fmt_vn = '4. Sau khi vượt qua phụ bản hiện tại, phụ bản tiếp theo sẽ được mở, các phụ bản đã vượt qua không thể chơi lại trước khi được đặt lại hàng tháng.'
	},
	[44005] = {
		id = 44005,
		fmt = '5. After completing each guild dungeon challenge, additional damage ranking rewards will be distributed based on contribution.',
		fmt_ma = '5. Selepas setiap cabaran dungeon persekutuan diselesaikan, ganjaran kedudukan kerosakan tambahan akan diberikan berdasarkan sumbangan dalam dungeon.  ',
		fmt_en = '5. After completing each guild dungeon challenge, additional damage ranking rewards will be distributed based on contribution.',
		fmt_in = '5. Setelah setiap tantangan dungeon guild selesai, hadiah peringkat damage tambahan akan diberikan berdasarkan kontribusi di dungeon',
		fmt_th = '5. หลังจากท้าทายดันเจี้ยนเสร็จ จะมีรางวัลอันดับความเสียหายเพิ่มแจกตามผลงานในดันเจี้ยน',
		fmt_ph = '5. Pagkatapos ng bawat matagumpay na challenge sa Guild Dungeon, ipapamahagi ang karagdagang damage ranking rewards batay sa kontribusyon sa dungeon.',
		fmt_vn = '5. Sau mỗi lần thử thách phó bản công hội hoàn thành, phần thưởng xếp hạng sát thương bổ sung sẽ được phát dựa trên đóng góp vào phó bản.'
	},
	[44006] = {
		id = 44006,
		fmt = '6. Each dungeon has a first-clear reward that can only be received once per player.',
		fmt_ma = '6. Setiap dungeon mempunyai ganjaran untuk kali pertama dikalahkan, setiap pemain hanya boleh menerima sekali.  ',
		fmt_en = '6. Each dungeon has a first-clear reward that can only be received once per player.',
		fmt_in = '6. Setiap dungeon memiliki hadiah first clear, tiap pemain hanya bisa menerima sekali',
		fmt_th = '6. ดันเจี้ยนแต่ละแห่งมีรางวัลผ่านครั้งแรก จำกัดรับ 1 ครั้งต่อคน',
		fmt_ph = '6. Bawat dungeon ay may unang clear reward, bawat manlalaro ay maaari lamang tumanggap nito isang beses.',
		fmt_vn = '6. Mỗi phụ bản có phần thưởng lần đầu vượt qua, mỗi người chơi chỉ có thể nhận một lần duy nhất.'
	},
	[44007] = {
		id = 44007,
		fmt = '7. Each dungeon will provide additional attack, defense, and HP buffs to guild members, depending on the number of cleared dungeons and duration. These buffs are only effective in the current dungeon.',
		fmt_ma = '7. Setiap dungeon akan memberikan buff tambahan serangan, pertahanan dan HP kepada ahli persekutuan bergantung pada bilangan dungeon yang telah diselesaikan dan tempoh masa. Buff ini hanya berkesan dalam dungeon semasa.  ',
		fmt_en = '7. Each dungeon will provide additional attack, defense, and HP buffs to guild members, depending on the number of cleared dungeons and duration. These buffs are only effective in the current dungeon.',
		fmt_in = '7. Setiap dungeon akan memberikan buff tambahan attack, defense, dan HP untuk pemain di guild, tergantung jumlah guild yang menyelesaikan dan waktu bertahan, buff ini hanya berlaku di dungeon saat ini',
		fmt_th = '7. แต่ละดันเจี้ยนจะเพิ่มบัฟโจมตี ป้องกัน และ HP ให้ผู้เล่นในกิลด์ ขึ้นอยู่กับจำนวนที่กิลด์ผ่านและระยะเวลาที่บัฟมีผล บัฟนี้มีผลเฉพาะในดันเจี้ยนนั้น',
		fmt_ph = '7. Bawat dungeon ay magdadagdag ng attack, defense, at HP buff sa mga miyembro ng guild, depende sa bilang ng dungeon na natapos at sa oras ng pananatili. Ang buff na ito ay epektibo lamang sa kasalukuyang dungeon.',
		fmt_vn = '7. Mỗi bản sao sẽ mang lại thêm các buff tấn công, phòng thủ và máu cho người chơi trong bang hội, tùy thuộc vào số lượng bang hội đã vượt qua và thời gian lưu lại. Buff này chỉ có hiệu lực trong bản sao hiện tại.'
	},
	[44008] = {
		id = 44008,
		fmt = '8. All dungeons are reset at the beginning of each month. After resetting, each cleared dungeon grants the entire guild a kill reward (not the first-clear reward);',
		fmt_ma = '8. Semua dungeon akan disegar semula pada awal bulan; selepas segar semula, setiap kali persekutuan menyelesaikan satu dungeon, seluruh persekutuan akan menerima ganjaran penaklukan (bukan ganjaran pertama kali).  ',
		fmt_en = '8. All dungeons are reset at the beginning of each month. After resetting, each cleared dungeon grants the entire guild a kill reward (not the first-clear reward);',
		fmt_in = '8. Setiap awal bulan, semua dungeon akan di-reset. Setelah reset, setiap kali guild menyelesaikan dungeon, seluruh guild akan menerima hadiah kill (bukan hadiah first clear)',
		fmt_th = '8. ทุกต้นเดือนจะรีเฟรชดันเจี้ยนใหม่ทั้งหมด เมื่อผ่านดันเจี้ยนจะได้รับรางวัลสังหารทั้งกิลด์ (ไม่ใช่รางวัลผ่านครั้งแรก)',
		fmt_ph = '8. Tuwing umpisa ng buwan, mare-reset ang lahat ng dungeon. Pagkatapos ng reset, sa bawat dungeon na malalampasan ng guild, makakatanggap ang buong guild ng kill rewards (hindi kabilang ang first clear rewards);',
		fmt_vn = '8. Hàng tháng, vào đầu tháng sẽ làm mới tất cả các phó bản. Sau khi làm mới, mỗi khi công hội vượt qua một phó bản, toàn bộ công hội sẽ nhận được phần thưởng tiêu diệt (không phải phần thưởng cho lần vượt ải đầu tiên);'
	},
	[44009] = {
		id = 44009,
		fmt = '9. Kill rewards (not the first-clear rewards) can only be received once per dungeon per reset cycle per player.',
		fmt_ma = '9. Ganjaran penaklukan (bukan ganjaran pertama kali) hanya boleh diterima sekali oleh setiap pemain untuk setiap dungeon dalam satu kitaran segar semula.',
		fmt_en = '9. Kill rewards (not the first-clear rewards) can only be received once per dungeon per reset cycle per player.',
		fmt_in = '9. Hadiah kill (bukan hadiah first clear) tiap pemain hanya bisa diterima satu kali per dungeon di setiap siklus reset',
		fmt_th = '9. รางวัลสังหาร (ไม่ใช่รางวัลผ่านครั้งแรก) จะรับได้ 1 ครั้งต่อดันเจี้ยนต่อรอบรีเฟรช',
		fmt_ph = '9. Ang kill rewards (hindi first clear rewards) ay maaari lamang makuha isang beses bawat dungeon sa bawat reset cycle.',
		fmt_vn = '9. Phần thưởng tiêu diệt (không phải phần thưởng lần đầu vượt qua) mỗi người chơi chỉ có thể nhận một lần cho mỗi phụ bản trong mỗi chu kỳ đặt lại.'
	},
	[44010] = {
		id = 44010,
		fmt = '10. After changing guilds, you cannot participate in guild dungeon challenges on the same day. You must wait until 5:00 AM the next day to participate;',
		fmt_ma = '10. Selepas menukar persekutuan, anda tidak boleh menyertai cabaran dungeon persekutuan pada hari tersebut, perlu tunggu hingga jam 5 pagi keesokan harinya.  ',
		fmt_en = '10. After changing guilds, you cannot participate in guild dungeon challenges on the same day. You must wait until 5:00 AM the next day to participate;',
		fmt_in = '10. Setelah pindah guild, kamu tidak bisa ikut tantangan dungeon guild di hari itu, harus menunggu sampai jam 5 pagi keesokan harinya',
		fmt_th = '10. เปลี่ยนกิลด์จะไม่สามารถท้าทายดันเจี้ยนในวันนั้น ต้องรอถึง 5:00 วันถัดไป',
		fmt_ph = '10. Pagkatapos lumipat ng guild, hindi ka maaaring lumahok sa Guild Dungeon challenge sa araw ng paglipat, kailangan maghintay hanggang 5AM ng susunod na araw;',
		fmt_vn = '10. Sau khi đổi bang hội, bạn không thể tham gia thử thách phó bản bang hội trong ngày hôm đó, mà phải đợi đến 5 giờ sáng ngày hôm sau mới có thể tham gia;'
	},
	[44011] = {
		id = 44011,
		fmt = '11. The player who delivers the finishing blow to the guild boss will receive additional gold and diamond rewards. The same boss kill reward can only be received once per monthly reset cycle.',
		fmt_ma = '11. Pemimpin yang membunuh bos persekutuan akan menerima ganjaran tambahan berupa emas dan berlian. Ganjaran penaklukan bos hanya boleh diterima sekali setiap kitaran bulanan.',
		fmt_en = '11. The player who delivers the finishing blow to the guild boss will receive additional gold and diamond rewards. The same boss kill reward can only be received once per monthly reset cycle.',
		fmt_in = '11. Pemimpin yang membunuh boss guild akan mendapatkan tambahan hadiah gold dan diamond. Hadiah kill boss yang sama hanya bisa diterima satu kali per siklus reset bulanan',
		fmt_th = '11. หัวหน้าที่สังหารบอสกิลด์จะได้รางวัลทองและเพชรเพิ่ม รางวัลสังหารบอสเดียวกันรับได้ 1 ครั้งต่อเดือน',
		fmt_ph = '11. Ang player na makakapatay ng Guild Boss ay makakatanggap ng karagdagang gold at diamond rewards. Ang kill rewards para sa parehong boss ay maaari lamang makuha isang beses kada buwanang reset.',
		fmt_vn = '11. Chỉ huy nào kết liễu boss bang hội sẽ nhận thêm phần thưởng vàng và kim cương. Phần thưởng tiêu diệt cùng một boss chỉ được nhận một lần trong chu kỳ thiết lập lại hàng tháng.'
	},
	[44012] = {
		id = 44012,
		fmt = '12. All kill rewards must be manually claimed from the gift box. Participation and finishing rewards will be distributed at the end of the challenge. Damage ranking rewards will be sent via mail.',
		fmt_ma = '12. Semua ganjaran penaklukan perlu dituntut secara manual di peti hadiah; ganjaran penyertaan dan ganjaran membunuh bos akan dihantar selepas cabaran tamat; ganjaran kedudukan kerosakan akan dihantar melalui mel.',
		fmt_en = '12. All kill rewards must be manually claimed from the gift box. Participation and finishing rewards will be distributed at the end of the challenge. Damage ranking rewards will be sent via mail.',
		fmt_in = '12. Semua hadiah kill harus diambil manual di kotak hadiah; hadiah partisipasi dan hadiah kill akan diberikan setelah tantangan selesai; hadiah peringkat damage akan dikirim lewat surat',
		fmt_th = '12. รางวัลสังหารทั้งหมดต้องกดรับเองในกล่องของขวัญ รางวัลเข้าร่วมและรางวัลสังหารจะมอบหลังจบท้าทาย รางวัลอันดับความเสียหายจะส่งทางจดหมาย',
		fmt_ph = '12. Lahat ng kill rewards ay kailangang kunin nang manu-mano sa gift box; ang participation at kill rewards ay ipapamahagi pagkatapos ng challenge; ang damage ranking rewards ay ipapadala sa mail.',
		fmt_vn = '12. Tất cả phần thưởng tiêu diệt cần được nhận thủ công trong hộp quà; phần thưởng tham gia và phần thưởng kết liễu sẽ được phát khi kết thúc thử thách; phần thưởng xếp hạng sát thương sẽ được gửi qua thư.'
	},
	[45001] = {
		id = 45001,
		fmt = '1. Each member can make one wish per day, posting the hero shard they want in the guild wish list.',
		fmt_ma = '1. Setiap ahli hanya boleh membuat satu permintaan sehari, memilih wira yang ingin mendapatkan cebisan dan buat permintaan dalam persekutuan.  ',
		fmt_en = '1. Each member can make one wish per day, posting the hero shard they want in the guild wish list.',
		fmt_in = '1. Setiap anggota bisa melakukan satu kali permintaan per hari, memilih pahlawan untuk meminta fragment di guild',
		fmt_th = '1. สมาชิกแต่ละวันอธิษฐานได้ 1 ครั้ง โพสต์ฮีโร่ที่ต้องการชิ้นส่วนในกิลด์',
		fmt_ph = '1. Bawat miyembro ay maaaring mag-wish isang beses bawat araw, maaaring i-post ang hero na nais makuha ng fragments sa guild wish.',
		fmt_vn = '1. Mỗi thành viên mỗi ngày có thể ước một lần, đăng anh hùng muốn nhận mảnh vào bang hội làm điều ước.'
	},
