		fmt = '1. Cross-server arena requires a waiting time to match players between servers. When matched successfully, the interface will display "Match successful, waiting to start battle"',
		fmt_ma = '1. Arena rentas server memerlukan masa untuk mencari lawan antara server. Bila berjaya, skrin akan memaparkan "Jodoh Berjaya", tunggu untuk mula.',
