	},
	[93003] = {
		id = 93003,
		fmt = '3. When a fish bites, players need to adjust the fishing hook to align with the fish\'s position. Press and hold to reel in the line (the hook moves up), release to let the hook move down.',
		fmt_ma = '3. Apabila ikan menggigit, pemain perlu melaraskan supaya mata kail sepadan dengan kedudukan ikan. Tekan/tahan untuk menggulung tali (mata kail naik), lepaskan untuk menurunkannya.',
		fmt_en = '3. When a fish bites, players need to adjust the fishing hook to align with the fish\'s position. Press and hold to reel in the line (the hook moves up), release to let the hook move down.',
		fmt_in = '3. Saat ikan menggigit, pemain harus menyesuaikan agar kail sejajar dengan posisi ikan. Tekan/tahan untuk menarik tali (kail bergerak naik), lepas untuk membuat kail turun.  ',
		fmt_th = '3. เมื่อปลากินเหยื่อ ผู้เล่นต้องปรับตำแหน่งเบ็ดให้ตรงกับตำแหน่งของปลา กด/กดค้างเพื่อดึงสายเบ็ด (เบ็ดจะเคลื่อนที่ขึ้น) ปล่อยเพื่อให้เบ็ดเคลื่อนที่ลง',
		fmt_ph = '3. Kapag may kagat, kailangan i-align ang hook sa isda. Press/hold para paakyat ang hook, release para pababa',
		fmt_vn = '3. Khi cá cắn câu, người chơi cần điều chỉnh sao cho lưỡi câu trùng với vị trí của cá. Nhấn/giữ để thu dây câu (lưỡi câu di chuyển lên), thả ra để lưỡi câu di chuyển xuống.'
	},
	[93004] = {
		id = 93004,
		fmt = '4. When the hook is aligned with the fish’s position, the fishing progress increases. Conversely, the progress decreases if it’s not aligned.',
		fmt_ma = '4. Apabila mata kail sepadan dengan kedudukan ikan, kemajuan memancing akan meningkat. Jika tidak sepadan, kemajuan akan menurun.',
		fmt_en = '4. When the hook is aligned with the fish’s position, the fishing progress increases. Conversely, the progress decreases if it’s not aligned.',
		fmt_in = '4. Jika kail sejajar dengan posisi ikan, progress akan meningkat. Jika tidak sejajar, progress akan menurun.  ',
		fmt_th = '4. เมื่อเบ็ดตรงกับตำแหน่งของปลา ความคืบหน้าในการตกปลาจะเพิ่มขึ้น หากไม่ตรง ความคืบหน้าจะลดลง',
		fmt_ph = '4. Kapag tama ang hook sa isda, tataas progress. Pag mali, bababa progress',
		fmt_vn = '4. Khi lưỡi câu trùng với vị trí của cá, tiến độ câu cá sẽ tăng. Ngược lại, tiến độ sẽ giảm.'
	},
	[93005] = {
		id = 93005,
		fmt = '5. When the progress bar reaches the top, the fishing is successful; if it hits the bottom, the fishing fails. Whether successful or not, the number of attempts and baits will be consumed.',
		fmt_ma = '5. Apabila bar kemajuan mencapai maksimum, pemancingan berjaya; jika bar kemajuan habis, pemancingan gagal. Sama ada berjaya atau gagal, bilangan dan umpan tetap digunakan.',
		fmt_en = '5. When the progress bar reaches the top, the fishing is successful; if it hits the bottom, the fishing fails. Whether successful or not, the number of attempts and baits will be consumed.',
		fmt_in = '5. Jika progress bar penuh, pemancingan berhasil; jika kosong, gagal. Baik berhasil atau gagal, percobaan dan umpan tetap dikonsumsi.  ',
		fmt_th = '5. เมื่อแถบความคืบหน้าถึงจุดสูงสุด การตกปลาจะสำเร็จ หากแถบความคืบหน้าถึงจุดต่ำสุด การตกปลาจะล้มเหลว ไม่ว่าจะสำเร็จหรือล้มเหลว จำนวนครั้งและเหยื่อจะถูกใช้ไป',
		fmt_ph = '5. Pag full progress bar, success; pag empty, fail. Try at bait mababawas pareho success/fail',
		fmt_vn = '5. Khi thanh tiến độ đạt đỉnh, câu cá thành công; nếu thanh tiến độ chạm đáy, câu cá thất bại. Dù thành công hay thất bại, số lần và mồi câu đều bị tiêu hao.'
	},
	[93006] = {
		id = 93006,
		fmt = '6. Using higher-quality fishing rods and baits can reduce the difficulty of the task or increase the success rate of auto-fishing.',
		fmt_ma = '6. Menggunakan batang dan umpan berkualiti tinggi boleh mengurangkan kesukaran atau meningkatkan kadar kejayaan pancing automatik.',
		fmt_en = '6. Using higher-quality fishing rods and baits can reduce the difficulty of the task or increase the success rate of auto-fishing.',
		fmt_in = '6. Menggunakan pancing dan umpan berkualitas tinggi bisa mengurangi tingkat kesulitan atau meningkatkan tingkat keberhasilan pemancingan otomatis.',
		fmt_th = '6. การใช้เบ็ดและเหยื่อคุณภาพสูงขึ้นจะช่วยลดความยากในการควบคุมหรือเพิ่มอัตราความสำเร็จเมื่อใช้ระบบตกปลาอัตโนมัติ',
		fmt_ph = '6. Mas mataas quality rod at bait, mas madali mag-fishing at mas mataas success rate sa auto fishing',
		fmt_vn = '6. Sử dụng cần câu và mồi câu chất lượng cao hơn có thể giảm độ khó thao tác hoặc tăng tỷ lệ thành công khi câu cá tự động.'
	},
	[93007] = {
		id = 93007,
		fmt = '7. As the fishing level increases, players will receive additional attributes for all heroes and reduced difficulty in fishing tasks.',
		fmt_ma = '7. Apabila tahap memancing meningkat, pemain akan menerima beberapa atribut tambahan untuk semua wira dan mengurangkan kesukaran ketika memancing.',
		fmt_en = '7. As the fishing level increases, players will receive additional attributes for all heroes and reduced difficulty in fishing tasks.',
		fmt_in = '7. Saat level memancing meningkat, pemain akan mendapatkan atribut tambahan untuk semua hero dan mengurangi tingkat kesulitan pemancingan.  ',
		fmt_th = '7. เมื่อเลเวลตกปลาเพิ่มขึ้น ผู้เล่นจะได้รับโบนัสคุณสมบัติต่างๆ สำหรับฮีโร่ทั้งหมด และลดความยากในการควบคุมการตกปลา',
		fmt_ph = '7. Mas mataas fishing level, may bonus stats para sa lahat ng heroes at easier fishing controls',
