		fmt_ma = '7. Dalam pertarungan Adil, #C0xF76B45#atribut dan kesan sistem seperti barang dibawa, rune, personaliti#C0xFFFFFF# tidak dibawa masuk. Kemahiran guild, kemahiran bakat, atribut haiwan roh kedua-dua pihak diselaraskan ke tahap seragam.  ',
		fmt_en = '7. In Fair Mode, #C0xF76B45#the attributes and effects of systems like carried items, runes, personality#C0xFFFFFF# will not be carried over. Guild skills, talent skills, and spirit beast attributes of both sides will be adjusted to a unified level.',
		fmt_in = '7. Dalam mode Adil, #C0xF76B45#atribut dan efek dari sistem seperti item bawaan, rune, kepribadian#C0xFFFFFF# tidak akan dibawa. Skill guild, skill talenta, atribut beast dari kedua sisi akan disesuaikan ke level yang sama.  ',
		fmt_th = '7. ในโหมดยุติธรรม #C0xF76B45#ค่าสถานะและผลของระบบต่าง ๆ เช่น ไอเท็ม รูน บุคลิก#C0xFFFFFF# จะไม่ถูกนำมาใช้ ทักษะกิลด์ ทักษะพรสวรรค์ และค่าสถานะสัตว์เลี้ยงจะถูกปรับเป็นมาตรฐาน',
		fmt_ph = '7. Sa Fair Mode, #C0xF76B45#effects ng items, runes, personalities#C0xFFFFFF# ay hindi isasama. Guild skills, talents, pet stats ay standardized',
		fmt_vn = '7. Trong trận đấu công bằng, #C0xF76B45#thuộc tính và hiệu ứng của các hệ thống như vật phẩm mang theo, rune, tính cách#C0xFFFFFF# sẽ không được mang vào. Kỹ năng bang hội, kỹ năng thiên phú, thuộc tính linh thú của cả hai bên sẽ được điều chỉnh về mức thống nhất.'
