		fmt_en = '4. At the end of the season, #C0xF76B45#settlement rewards will be issued 30 minutes after the match ends on the last day. Ranking rewards will be based on the highest current ranking in both modes. #C0xF76B45#Note: In the season, only players who have participated in at least 1 match (regardless of mode) can receive settlement rewards.',
		fmt_in = '4. Di akhir musim, #C0xF76B45# hadiah akhir musim akan diberikan 30 menit setelah pertandingan terakhir hari terakhir. Hadiah peringkat berdasarkan peringkat tertinggi dari dua mode akan didistribusikan #C0xF76B45# Catatan: Dalam satu musim, hanya pemain yang setidaknya berpartisipasi 1 pertandingan (mode apapun) yang bisa menerima hadiah akhir.  ',
		fmt_th = '4. เมื่อสิ้นสุดฤดูกาล #C0xF76B45#จะมอบรางวัลชดเชย 30 นาทีหลังจบการต่อสู้วันสุดท้าย รางวัลอันดับจะขึ้นกับอันดับสูงสุดในสองโหมด #C0xF76B45# หมายเหตุ: ต้องเล่นอย่างน้อย 1 แมตช์ต่อฤดูกาล (โหมดใดก็ได้) ถึงจะได้รับรางวัล',
		fmt_ph = '4. End of season settlement rewards ilalabas 30 mins after last match sa final day. Highest rank sa either mode ang pagbabasehan ng rewards. Kailangan maglaro ng at least 1 match para maka-claim',
		fmt_vn = '4. Vào cuối mùa giải, #C0xF76B45# sẽ phát hành phần thưởng quyết toán, sẽ là #C0xFFFFFF# 30 phút sau khi kết thúc trận đấu vào ngày cuối cùng. Phần thưởng xếp hạng tương ứng với thứ hạng hiện tại cao nhất trong hai chế độ. sẽ được phân phối #C0xF76B45# Lưu ý: Trong mùa giải Chỉ những người chơi đã tham gia ít nhất 1 trận đấu (bất kể chế độ) mới có thể nhận được phần thưởng quyết toán.'
	},
