		fmt_in = '2. Event memiliki beberapa ronde flip kartu, setiap ronde memiliki hadiah besar, hadiah bisa berada di bawah kartu mana saja, setelah dibuka akan mendapatkan hadiah dan melanjutkan ke ronde berikutnya.',
		fmt_th = '2.กิจกรรมนี้มีหลายรอบการเปิดการ์ด แต่ละรอบมีรางวัลใหญ่พิเศษ รางวัลใหญ่อาจอยู่ใต้การ์ดใดก็ได้ เมื่อเปิดเจอจะได้รับรางวัลทันทีและเข้าสู่รอบต่อไป',
		fmt_ph = '2. Ang event ay mayroong maraming round ng Flip Card, bawat round ay may grand prize na maaaring nakatago sa anumang card. Kapag nahanap, agad na matatanggap ang premyo at lilipat sa susunod na round.',
		fmt_vn = '2. Hoạt động thiết lập nhiều vòng lật thẻ, mỗi vòng lật thẻ có một giải thưởng siêu lớn, giải thưởng lớn có thể nằm dưới bất kỳ thẻ nào, lật được sẽ nhận thưởng ngay và tiếp tục vòng lật thẻ tiếp theo.'
	},
	[104003] = {
		id = 104003,
		fmt = '3. Opening a card consumes a turn, and it will prioritize consuming free turns. Free turns reset daily at 5 AM; after that, it will consume mission turns, which do not reset and can be earned by completing tasks.',
		fmt_ma = '3. Membuka akan menggunakan giliran, giliran percuma diutamakan, giliran percuma direset setiap hari pada jam 5 pagi; selepas itu giliran tugasan digunakan, giliran tugasan tidak direset, boleh diperoleh dengan menyiapkan tugasan.  ',
		fmt_en = '3. Opening a card consumes a turn, and it will prioritize consuming free turns. Free turns reset daily at 5 AM; after that, it will consume mission turns, which do not reset and can be earned by completing tasks.',
		fmt_in = '3. Membuka kartu akan menghabiskan kesempatan, diutamakan menggunakan kesempatan gratis, kesempatan gratis direset setiap hari pukul 05:00; setelah itu menggunakan kesempatan dari misi, kesempatan misi tidak direset, bisa diperoleh dengan menyelesaikan misi.',
		fmt_th = '3.การเปิดการ์ดจะใช้จำนวนครั้ง โดยจะใช้จำนวนครั้งฟรีก่อน จำนวนครั้งฟรีจะรีเซ็ตทุกวันเวลา 5:00 น. จากนั้นจะใช้จำนวนครั้งจากภารกิจ ซึ่งจะไม่รีเซ็ตและสามารถรับได้จากการทำภารกิจ',
		fmt_ph = '3. Ang pagbukas ng card ay gumagamit ng mga attempts, unahin munang gamitin ang libreng attempts, na mare-reset tuwing 5AM; kasunod nito ay gagamitin ang task attempts, na hindi nare-reset at maaaring makuha sa pamamagitan ng pagkompleto ng mga task.',
		fmt_vn = '3. Mở bài sẽ tiêu hao lượt, ưu tiên tiêu hao lượt miễn phí, lượt miễn phí được reset hàng ngày lúc 5 giờ; sau đó tiêu hao lượt nhiệm vụ, lượt nhiệm vụ không được reset, có thể nhận được bằng cách hoàn thành nhiệm vụ.'
	},
