		fmt_in = '1. Game menyediakan 3 hero dengan darah, kecepatan gerak, dan ukuran berbeda untuk dipilih, pemain bisa memilih hero yang dikuasai sebelum mulai game.',
		fmt_th = '1.เกมมีฮีโร่ 3 ตัวให้เลือก มีค่าเลือด ความเร็ว และขนาดต่างกัน เลือกตัวที่ถนัดก่อนเริ่มเกม',
		fmt_ph = '1. Nagbibigay ang laro ng 3 bayani na may iba\'t ibang HP, bilis ng galaw, at laki, maaaring pumili ang manlalaro ng bayani na nais gamitin bago magsimula ang laro.',
		fmt_vn = '1.Trò chơi cung cấp 3 anh hùng có lượng máu, tốc độ di chuyển và kích thước khác nhau để lựa chọn, người chơi có thể tự do chọn anh hùng mà mình giỏi trước mỗi lần bắt đầu trò chơi.'
	},
	[110002] = {
		id = 110002,
		fmt = '2. The game starts, and snowballs and gift boxes will fall from the sky. If you are hit by a snowball, you will lose 1 health point. Picking up gift boxes will earn you points. The game ends when time runs out or health points reach 0.',
		fmt_ma = '2. Apabila permainan bermula, bola salji dan kotak hadiah akan jatuh, terkena bola salji akan hilang 1 nyawa, mengambil kotak hadiah akan tambah mata, permainan tamat apabila masa habis atau nyawa 0',
		fmt_en = '2. The game starts, and snowballs and gift boxes will fall from the sky. If you are hit by a snowball, you will lose 1 health point. Picking up gift boxes will earn you points. The game ends when time runs out or health points reach 0.',
		fmt_in = '2. Saat game dimulai, bola salju dan kotak hadiah akan jatuh dari langit, terkena bola salju sekali akan kehilangan 1 nyawa, mengumpulkan kotak hadiah akan mendapatkan poin, game berakhir saat waktu habis atau nyawa habis.',
		fmt_th = '2.เมื่อเริ่มเกม ลูกบอลหิมะและกล่องของขวัญจะตกลงมา ถูกลูกบอลหิมะชนจะเสีย 1 HP เก็บกล่องของขวัญจะได้คะแนน เกมจบเมื่อหมดเวลา หรือ HP เหลือ 0',
		fmt_ph = '2. Kapag nagsimula ang laro, magbabagsakan ang mga snowball at gift box mula sa itaas. Kapag tinamaan ng snowball, mababawasan ng 1 life point, kapag nakakuha ng gift box, madadagdagan ang puntos. Matatapos ang laro kapag ubos na ang oras o kapag ubos na ang life points.',
		fmt_vn = '2. Trò chơi bắt đầu, những quả cầu tuyết và hộp quà sẽ rơi từ trên trời xuống, bị quả cầu tuyết rơi trúng 1 lần sẽ mất 1 điểm sinh mạng, nhặt được hộp quà sẽ được cộng điểm, trò chơi kết thúc khi hết thời gian hoặc khi điểm sinh mạng bị giảm xuống 0.'
	},
	[110003] = {
		id = 110003,
		fmt = '3. #C0xF76B45# Snowfall is very fast, so pay attention to the shadow at your feet; gift boxes will disappear after hitting the ground for a while, so pick them up quickly. Picking up boxes will grant points. The longer the hero stays on the field, the more bonus points they will earn!',
		fmt_ma = '3. #C0xF76B45#Salji jatuh dengan laju, perhatikan bayang kaki; kotak hadiah akan hilang selepas beberapa ketika di tanah, kutip segera untuk tambah mata; hero yang bertahan lama di arena akan terima lebih banyak mata',
		fmt_en = '3. #C0xF76B45# Snowfall is very fast, so pay attention to the shadow at your feet; gift boxes will disappear after hitting the ground for a while, so pick them up quickly. Picking up boxes will grant points. The longer the hero stays on the field, the more bonus points they will earn!',
		fmt_in = '3. #C0xF76B45#Salju jatuh sangat cepat, perhatikan bayangan di bawah; Kotak hadiah akan hilang setelah beberapa saat jatuh, jadi harus cepat diambil, akan mendapatkan poin; Semakin lama hero bertahan di arena, semakin banyak poin bonus yang didapat!',
		fmt_th = '3.#C0xF76B45#หิมะตกเร็วมาก โปรดระวังเงา; กล่องของขวัญจะหายไปหลังตกลงพื้น ต้องรีบเก็บ จะได้รับคะแนน; ยืนอยู่ได้นานจะได้คะแนนเพิ่ม',
		fmt_ph = '3. #C0xF76B45#Mabilis ang bagsak ng snow, bantayan ang anino sa paa; mawawala ang gift box kapag di agad nakuha, kaya dapat mabilis itong kunin. Mas matagal ang bayani sa field, mas mataas ang puntos na makukuha!',
		fmt_vn = '3.#C0xF76B45#Tuyết rơi rất nhanh, chú ý bóng dưới chân; Hộp quà sẽ biến mất sau khi rơi xuống đất một lúc, cần nhặt nhanh chóng, nhặt được sẽ nhận điểm; Anh hùng tồn tại trên sân càng lâu, càng nhận được điểm thưởng nhiều hơn nhé!'
	},
