	[113080] = {
		id = 113080,
		fmt = '1. If the player challenges proactively, and #C0xF76B45# wins, they will swap ranks with the higher-ranked player, inheriting the new rank\'s production speed and reward points, as well as a portion of the opponent\'s Trial Coins; if challenging a lower-ranked player, the rank and related content will not change, but the player can still receive a portion of the opponent’s Trial Coins.',
		fmt_ma = '1. Pemain yang mencabar, jika #C0xF76B45#menang, akan tukar tempat dengan lawan ranking lebih tinggi, warisi kadar penghasilan dan mata ranking baru serta sebahagian Syiling Percubaan lawan; jika lawan ranking lebih rendah, ranking tak berubah, hanya dapat sebahagian syiling',
		fmt_en = '1. If the player challenges proactively, and #C0xF76B45# wins, they will swap ranks with the higher-ranked player, inheriting the new rank\'s production speed and reward points, as well as a portion of the opponent\'s Trial Coins; if challenging a lower-ranked player, the rank and related content will not change, but the player can still receive a portion of the opponent’s Trial Coins.',
		fmt_in = '1. Pemain yang menantang secara aktif, jika #C0xF76B45# menang, akan bertukar peringkat dengan lawan yang lebih tinggi, mewarisi kecepatan produksi dan hadiah peringkat baru, serta sebagian Koin Uji lawan; jika melawan lawan yang lebih rendah, peringkat tidak berubah tetapi tetap dapat memperoleh sebagian Koin Uji lawan',
		fmt_th = '1.ผู้เล่นที่ท้าทายสำเร็จ #C0xF76B45#จะสลับตำแหน่งกับผู้เล่นที่มีอันดับสูงกว่า พร้อมรับอัตราการผลิตและคะแนนรางวัลของอันดับใหม่ รวมถึงบางส่วนของเหรียญทดลองของฝ่ายตรงข้าม หากท้าทายผู้เล่นอันดับต่ำกว่าจะไม่เปลี่ยนอันดับแต่จะได้รับเหรียญทดลองบางส่วน',
		fmt_ph = '1. Kapag nag-challenge ang player at #C0xF76B45# nanalo, magpapalit ng ranking sa mas mataas na player, at mamanahin ang production speed at ranking points ng bagong ranking, pati na bahagi ng Trial Coins ng kalaban; kapag natalo ang mas mababang ranked player, hindi mababago ang ranking pero maaaring makakuha ng bahagi ng Trial Coins ng kalaban.',
		fmt_vn = '1. Người chơi chủ động khiêu chiến, nếu #C0xF76B45# chiến thắng, sẽ đổi vị trí với người chơi có thứ hạng cao hơn, đồng thời kế thừa tốc độ sản xuất và điểm thưởng của thứ hạng mới, cũng như một phần Xu Thử Luyện của đối thủ; nếu đấu với đối thủ có thứ hạng thấp hơn, sẽ không đổi thứ hạng và các nội dung liên quan, nhưng có thể nhận được một phần Xu Thử Luyện của đối thủ.'
	},
	[113081] = {
		id = 113081,
		fmt = '2. When the opponent proactively attacks and wins, the player can take revenge, #C0xF76B45# but the number of revenge attempts on the same target is limited. Revenge also yields a portion of the Trial Coins from the target, but does not change the rank, and the target may also activate revenge against the player.',
		fmt_ma = '2. Jika diserang dan kalah, boleh balas dendam, #C0xF76B45#jumlah balas dendam pada sasaran terhad, balas dendam boleh dapat sebahagian syiling lawan tapi ranking tak berubah dan boleh aktifkan balas dendam dari lawan',
		fmt_en = '2. When the opponent proactively attacks and wins, the player can take revenge, #C0xF76B45# but the number of revenge attempts on the same target is limited. Revenge also yields a portion of the Trial Coins from the target, but does not change the rank, and the target may also activate revenge against the player.',
		fmt_in = '2. Jika lawan menyerang dan menang, pemain bisa melakukan balas dendam, #C0xF76B45# jumlah balas dendam untuk target yang sama dibatasi, balas dendam juga dapat memperoleh sebagian Koin Uji lawan, namun tidak mengubah peringkat dan bisa memicu target membalas kembali',
		fmt_th = '2.หากถูกฝ่ายตรงข้ามโจมตีและแพ้ ผู้เล่นสามารถล้างแค้นได้ #C0xF76B45#จำนวนครั้งในการล้างแค้นต่อเป้าหมายมีจำกัด การล้างแค้นสามารถรับเหรียญทดลองบางส่วนแต่จะไม่เปลี่ยนอันดับ และอาจกระตุ้นเป้าหมายให้ล้างแค้นกลับ',
		fmt_ph = '2. Kapag umatake at nanalo ang kalaban, maaari kang mag-revenge, #C0xF76B45#may limit sa revenge attempts sa parehong target, at maaari ring makakuha ng Trial Coins, pero hindi mababago ang ranking at maaaring ma-trigger ang target na mag-revenge.',
		fmt_vn = '2. Khi đối phương chủ động tấn công và chiến thắng, bạn có thể trả thù, #C0xF76B45# số lần trả thù đối với cùng một mục tiêu có giới hạn, trả thù cũng có thể nhận được một phần Xu Thử Thách của mục tiêu, nhưng không thay đổi thứ hạng và có thể kích hoạt mục tiêu trả thù bạn.'
	},
