		fmt_en = 'The server of the player who defeats the BOSS will receive an additional buff, one of three effects: attribute enhancement, increased production, and enhanced looting ability.',
		fmt_in = 'Server pemain yang mengalahkan BOSS akan mendapatkan buff tambahan: peningkatan atribut, produksi, atau kemampuan penjarahan',
		fmt_th = '5.เซิร์ฟเวอร์ที่กำจัด BOSS จะได้รับบัฟพิเศษแบบสุ่ม 1 ใน 3 อย่าง ได้แก่ เพิ่มสเตตัส เพิ่มผลผลิต และเพิ่มความสามารถในการปล้นสะดม',
		fmt_ph = 'Ang server na pumatay sa BOSS ay makakatanggap ng bonus buff, isa sa tatlong effects: attribute boost, production increase, o plunder boost.',
		fmt_vn = 'Máy chủ của người chơi tiêu diệt BOSS sẽ nhận được một buff bổ sung, một trong ba hiệu ứng: tăng cường thuộc tính, tăng sản lượng và tăng khả năng cướp đoạt.'
	},
