	},
	[124303] = {
		id = 124303,
		fmt = '3. The Hero Journey is divided into two routes: regular and advanced, waiting to be explored. The content, progress, and enhancement effects of these two routes are independent and do not affect each other.',
		fmt_ma = '3. Pengembaraan Wira dibahagikan kepada dua laluan: biasa dan lanjutan, menunggu untuk diterokai. Kandungan, kemajuan, dan kesan pengukuhan kedua-dua laluan adalah berasingan dan tidak saling mempengaruhi.  ',
		fmt_en = '3. The Hero Journey is divided into two routes: regular and advanced, waiting to be explored. The content, progress, and enhancement effects of these two routes are independent and do not affect each other.',
		fmt_in = '3. Petualangan Hero dibagi menjadi dua jalur: normal dan lanjutan, menunggu untuk dijelajahi. Isi, progres, dan efek kedua jalur ini terpisah dan tidak saling mempengaruhi',
		fmt_th = '3. เส้นทางฮีโร่แบ่งเป็นสองเส้นทาง: ธรรมดาและขั้นสูง รอการสำรวจ เนื้อหา ความคืบหน้า และบัฟของแต่ละเส้นทางจะแยกกัน ไม่กระทบกัน',
		fmt_ph = '3. Nahahati ang Hero\'s Journey sa dalawang ruta: normal at advanced, na naghihintay sa iyong pagtuklas. Ang nilalaman, progreso, at buffs ng dalawang ruta ay independent at hindi nakakaapekto sa isa\'t isa  ',
		fmt_vn = '3. Hành trình anh hùng được chia thành hai tuyến đường: thường và nâng cao, chờ người khám phá. Nội dung, tiến độ và hiệu quả tăng cường của hai tuyến đường này độc lập với nhau, không ảnh hưởng lẫn nhau.'
	},
	[124304] = {
		id = 124304,
		fmt = '4. The regular route restores 1 challenge attempt every 48 hours, and the advanced route restores 1 challenge attempt every 96 hours; the recovery time is 5 AM, and the maximum number of accumulated attempts is 5.',
		fmt_ma = '4. Laluan biasa memulihkan 1 cubaan setiap 48 jam, laluan lanjutan memulihkan 1 cubaan setiap 96 jam; masa pemulihan adalah jam 5 pagi, maksimum cubaan terkumpul adalah 5 kali.  ',
		fmt_en = '4. The regular route restores 1 challenge attempt every 48 hours, and the advanced route restores 1 challenge attempt every 96 hours; the recovery time is 5 AM, and the maximum number of accumulated attempts is 5.',
		fmt_in = '4. Jalur normal memulihkan 1 kali kesempatan tantangan setiap 48 jam, jalur lanjutan setiap 96 jam; waktu reset pukul 5 pagi, maksimum akumulasi tantangan 5 kali',
		fmt_th = '4. เส้นทางธรรมดาจะฟื้นฟู 1 ครั้งทุก 48 ชั่วโมง เส้นทางขั้นสูงจะฟื้นฟู 1 ครั้งทุก 96 ชั่วโมง เวลาฟื้นฟูคือ 5 โมงเช้า สะสมได้สูงสุด 5 ครั้ง',
		fmt_ph = '4. Ang normal path ay magre-refresh ng isang challenge attempt kada 48 oras, ang advanced path kada 96 oras; ang oras ng refresh ay alas-5 ng umaga, at ang maximum na naipong attempts ay 5',
		fmt_vn = '4. Đường thường phục hồi 1 lần số lần thử thách sau 48 giờ, đường nâng cao phục hồi 1 lần số lần thử thách sau 96 giờ; thời gian phục hồi là 5 giờ sáng, số lần thử thách tích lũy tối đa là 5 lần.'
	},
	[124305] = {
		id = 124305,
		fmt = '5. Each opened route will save its challenge status until the corresponding reset attempt node is reached. The system will reset the route’s content when the corresponding reset attempt node is reached.',
		fmt_ma = '5. Setiap laluan yang dibuka akan menyimpan status cubaan sehingga mencapai titik pemulihan yang berkaitan. Sistem akan menetapkan semula kandungan laluan tersebut pada titik pemulihan yang bersesuaian.',
		fmt_en = '5. Each opened route will save its challenge status until the corresponding reset attempt node is reached. The system will reset the route’s content when the corresponding reset attempt node is reached.',
		fmt_in = '5. Setiap jalur yang dibuka akan menyimpan status tantangan hingga mencapai titik reset kesempatan. Sistem akan mereset isi jalur tersebut pada titik reset',
		fmt_th = '5. เมื่อเปิดเส้นทาง ระบบจะบันทึกสถานะจนถึงจุดรีเซ็ตจำนวนครั้ง ระบบจะรีเซ็ตเส้นทางเมื่อถึงจุดรีเซ็ต',
		fmt_ph = '5. Ang bawat binuksang ruta ay mag-iimbak ng estado ng hamon ng rutang iyon hanggang maabot ang katumbas na recovery node ng bilang ng mga pagkakataon. Ang sistema ay magrereset ng nilalaman ng ruta sa katumbas na recovery node ng bilang ng mga pagkakataon.',
		fmt_vn = '5. Mỗi tuyến đường được mở sẽ lưu trạng thái thử thách của tuyến đường đó cho đến khi đạt đến nút khôi phục số lần tương ứng. Hệ thống sẽ đặt lại nội dung tuyến đường đó tại nút khôi phục số lần tương ứng.'
	},
	[124306] = {
		id = 124306,
		fmt = '6. During or after completing a challenge, players can choose to manually end the challenge or wait for the system to automatically reset the route content.',
		fmt_ma = '6. Semasa atau selepas mencabar, pemain boleh memilih untuk menamatkan cabaran secara manual atau menunggu sistem menetapkan semula kandungan laluan secara automatik.  ',
		fmt_en = '6. During or after completing a challenge, players can choose to manually end the challenge or wait for the system to automatically reset the route content.',
		fmt_in = '6. Saat atau setelah menyelesaikan tantangan, pemain bisa memilih mengakhiri tantangan secara manual atau menunggu sistem mereset otomatis',
		fmt_th = '6. ระหว่างหรือหลังทำภารกิจ ผู้เล่นสามารถเลือกจบเองหรือรอระบบรีเซ็ตอัตโนมัติ',
		fmt_ph = '6. Sa panahon o matapos matapos ang hamon, maaaring piliin ng manlalaro na tapusin ang hamon nang manu-mano o hintayin ang sistema na awtomatikong i-reset ang nilalaman ng ruta.',
		fmt_vn = '6. Trong hoặc sau khi hoàn thành thử thách, người chơi có thể chọn kết thúc thử thách thủ công hoặc chờ hệ thống tự động thiết lập lại nội dung tuyến đường.'
	},
	[124307] = {
		id = 124307,
		fmt = '7. When players reach a certain level, the Overpower mode will be unlocked. Based on the highest historical performance and the most recent completed stage, you can overpower certain stages. Overpowering will help you pass levels without any damage and earn full rewards.',
		fmt_ma = '7. Apabila pemain mencapai tahap tertentu, mod "Overwhelm" akan dibuka, berdasarkan rekod tertinggi dan peringkat terkini, membolehkan pemain menakluk beberapa peringkat tertentu dengan segera. "Overwhelm" memberikan ganjaran penuh tanpa kehilangan.',
		fmt_en = '7. When players reach a certain level, the Overpower mode will be unlocked. Based on the highest historical performance and the most recent completed stage, you can overpower certain stages. Overpowering will help you pass levels without any damage and earn full rewards.',
		fmt_in = '7. Ketika pemain mencapai level tertentu, mode Dominasi akan terbuka, berdasarkan rekor tertinggi dan stage tertinggi baru-baru ini, bisa mendominasi beberapa lantai tertentu. Dominasi membantu melewati tanpa kerugian dan langsung mendapat semua hadiah',
		fmt_th = '7. เมื่อผู้เล่นถึงเลเวลที่กำหนด จะปลดล็อกโหมดกวาดล้าง โดยอิงจากผลงานสูงสุดและด่านล่าสุด สามารถกวาดล้างบางชั้นได้ กวาดล้างจะไม่เสียพลังและรับรางวัลครบ',
		fmt_ph = '7. Kapag umabot ang manlalaro sa isang tiyak na antas, magbubukas ang Overwhelm mode, batay sa pinakamataas na rekord sa kasaysayan at pinakamataas na kamakailang level, maaaring ma-overwhelm ang ilang mga tiyak na palapag. Ang Overwhelm ay tutulong na makalusot sa stage nang walang pinsala at makakuha ng lahat ng gantimpala.',
		fmt_vn = '7. Khi người chơi đạt đến cấp độ nhất định sẽ mở khóa chế độ áp đảo, dựa trên thành tích cao nhất lịch sử và màn chơi cao nhất gần đây, có thể áp đảo một số tầng nhất định. Áp đảo sẽ giúp vượt ải không tổn hại và nhận được toàn bộ phần thưởng.'
	},
