		fmt_en = '2. The Battle of the Chamber consists of two phases: the qualifiers and the finals. The qualifiers take place on #C0xF76B45#Friday#C0xFFFFFF# of the open week, and the finals take place on #C0xF76B45#Sunday#C0xFFFFFF# of the open week.',
		fmt_in = '2. Perang Konstruksi dibagi dua tahap: kualifikasi dan final. Kualifikasi diadakan hari #C0xF76B45#Jumat#C0xFFFFFF#, final hari #C0xF76B45#Minggu#C0xFFFFFF# di minggu keempat',
		fmt_th = '2.ศึกแบ่งเป็น 2 รอบ รอบคัดเลือกและรอบชิง รอบคัดเลือกจัดวัน #C0xF76B45#ศุกร์#C0xFFFFFF# ของสัปดาห์เปิด รอบชิงจัดวัน #C0xF76B45#อาทิตย์#C0xFFFFFF# ของสัปดาห์เปิด',
		fmt_ph = '2. Ang Guild War ay may dalawang yugto: preliminaries at finals. Ang preliminaries ay sa #C0xF76B45#Biyernes#C0xFFFFFF# ng linggo ng pagbubukas, at ang finals ay sa #C0xF76B45#Linggo#C0xFFFFFF# ng linggo ng pagbubukas.  ',
		fmt_vn = '2.Cuộc Chiến Bộ Phòng gồm hai giai đoạn: vòng loại và chung kết. Vòng loại diễn ra vào #C0xF76B45#thứ Sáu#C0xFFFFFF# của tuần mở, chung kết diễn ra vào #C0xF76B45#Chủ Nhật#C0xFFFFFF# của tuần mở.'
