	[125539] = {
		id = 125539,
		fmt = '1. During the Battle of the Chamber event, in each round, all heroes entering the battle team for the first time will receive attribute boosts like attack, defense, and speed.',
		fmt_ma = '1. Sepanjang Pertempuran Bahagian, dalam setiap pusingan pertempuran, semua hero yang pertama kali memasuki pasukan akan menerima peningkatan atribut seperti serangan, pertahanan, kelajuan.  ',
		fmt_en = '1. During the Battle of the Chamber event, in each round, all heroes entering the battle team for the first time will receive attribute boosts like attack, defense, and speed.',
		fmt_in = '1. Selama Perang Konstruksi, di setiap ronde pertama masuk tim, semua hero akan mendapatkan peningkatan atribut seperti serangan, pertahanan, kecepatan',
		fmt_th = '1.ตลอดการแข่งศึกห้องนิรภัย ในแต่ละรอบ ฮีโร่ที่ลงสนามครั้งแรกจะได้รับค่าสถานะเพิ่ม เช่น โจมตี ป้องกัน ความเร็ว',
		fmt_ph = '1. Sa buong panahon ng Guild War, sa bawat round, ang mga bayani na unang isinama sa team ay makakatanggap ng dagdag na stats tulad ng atake, depensa, at bilis.  ',
		fmt_vn = '1.Trong suốt thời gian thi đấu Cuộc Chiến Bộ Phòng, trong mỗi vòng đối đầu, tất cả các anh hùng lần đầu vào đội chiến đấu sẽ nhận được một số gia tăng thuộc tính như tấn công, phòng thủ, tốc độ.'
	},
	[125540] = {
		id = 125540,
		fmt = '2. As the battle progresses, these attribute boosts will gradually decrease, and the heroes will become fatigued, with their combat abilities weakening over time.',
		fmt_ma = '2. Apabila pertempuran berlarutan, peningkatan atribut ini akan berkurangan, dan hero akan menjadi letih, keupayaan tempur semakin lemah.  ',
		fmt_en = '2. As the battle progresses, these attribute boosts will gradually decrease, and the heroes will become fatigued, with their combat abilities weakening over time.',
		fmt_in = '2. Seiring waktu, peningkatan ini akan berkurang, hero menjadi lelah, kemampuan menurun',
		fmt_th = '2.เมื่อศึกยืดเยื้อ ค่าสถานะที่เพิ่มจะลดลง และฮีโร่จะเหนื่อย ความสามารถลดลงเรื่อยๆ',
		fmt_ph = '2. Habang tumatagal ang laban, ang mga dagdag na stats ay unti-unting bumababa at ang mga bayani ay napapagod, kaya humihina ang kanilang kakayahan sa laban.  ',
		fmt_vn = '2.Khi trận đấu kéo dài, các gia tăng thuộc tính này sẽ bị giảm dần, và anh hùng sẽ trở nên mệt mỏi, khả năng chiến đấu ngày càng yếu đi.'
	},
	[125541] = {
		id = 125541,
		fmt = '3. Subsequently, each time a hero participates in a battle, their attributes such as attack, defense, speed, and healing amount will continue to decrease.',
		fmt_ma = '3. Selepas itu, setiap kali bertempur, atribut seperti serangan, pertahanan, kelajuan, dan pemulihan hero dalam pasukan akan terus menurun.  ',
